---

Third-party data: data/MRHead.nrrd is the "MRHead" sample volume of the 3D Slicer project
(https://github.com/Slicer/SlicerTestingData), distributed under the 3D Slicer license
(BSD-style). It is included unchanged for the course demo only.

Third-party runtime: runtime/ is a Java runtime image of OpenJDK 25.0.1 for Windows x64, made with
jlink (modules java.base, java.datatransfer, java.desktop, java.prefs, java.xml). OpenJDK is licensed
under the GNU General Public License, version 2, with the Classpath Exception; its license and
third-party notices are in runtime/legal/. It is included unchanged so the app runs without a
separate Java installation.
